    kind: invariant  # 9956
    title: "The selection index loses true edges: a run that measures one package deletes each test's edges into every other package, so narrowing drops tests that execute the changed code (66 test files on a py.py change today)"  # 9956
    status: violated  # 9956
    priority: 2  # 9956
